Diagnostics (CONFIG_JZ_DIAG_LASTPANIC, default n): keep the last panic/oops/restart
reason and epc in RTC RTCSAR, which survives the WDT reset (DRAM and CPM CPSPR do not),
plus an unproven second copy with ra/sp in CP0 EPC/EntryLo0/EntryLo1/EntryHi;
show it in /proc/diag_lastpanic. T23/T31 only; no effect unless enabled.

